  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\xDCcretsiz Plan:\nG\xFCnl\xFCk
    s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 say\u0131da g\xF6rsel \xFCretimi, temel ara\xE7lara eri\u015Fim.\n\nBasic
    Plan:\nAyl\u0131k 7$, h\u0131zl\u0131 g\xF6rsel \xFCretimi, \xF6ncelikli s\u0131ra
    eri\u015Fimi, y\xFCksek kaliteli indirme se\xE7enekleri.\n\nPlus Plan:\nAyl\u0131k
    15$, \xF6zel \xFCretimler, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z yava\u015F komutlar, CSV dosyalar\u0131yla
    toplu \xFCretim imkan\u0131.\n\nPro Plan:\nAyl\u0131k 25$, t\xFCm Plus \xF6zellikleri,
    Ideogram Editor eri\u015Fimi, \xF6zel destek hizmeti.\n\nTeam Plan:\nAyl\u0131k
    50$, ekipler i\xE7in i\u015Fbirli\u011Fi ara\xE7lar\u0131, API eri\u015Fimi,
    \xF6zel e\u011Fitim ve destek.\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
