    i\xE7erik olu\u015Fturma platformudur. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 dostu aray\xFCz\xFC
    sayesinde, teknik bilgiye ihtiya\xE7 duymadan yarat\u0131c\u0131 projeler olu\u015Fturman\u0131za
    olanak tan\u0131r."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
