  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan:\nAyl\u0131k
    10 k\xFC\xE7\xFCk resim olu\u015Fturma kredisi, temel ara\xE7lara eri\u015Fim.\n\nBasic
    Plan:\nAyl\u0131k 12.49$, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z k\xFC\xE7\xFCk resim fikirleri,
    ayn\u0131 anda 3 A/B testi, ayl\u0131k 150 AI de\u011Ferlendirmesi, 200 AI olu\u015Fturma
    kredisi, 1 kanal deste\u011Fi, \xF6zel Discord grubu eri\u015Fimi.\nAI Tools\n\nPro
    Plan:\nAyl\u0131k 22.99$, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z k\xFC\xE7\xFCk resim fikirleri,
    s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z A/B testleri, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z AI de\u011Ferlendirmesi
    ve olu\u015Fturma, \xE7oklu kanal deste\u011Fi, \xF6zel Discord grubu eri\u015Fimi.\n\nLifetime
    Plan:\nTek seferlik \xF6deme ile t\xFCm Pro \xF6zelliklerine \xF6m\xFCr boyu
    eri\u015Fim, \xF6zel Discord kanal\u0131, \xE7oklu kanal deste\u011Fi."
