  m_text: "* Ger\xE7ek Zamanl\u0131 \xDCretim: Metin girdilerinizi an\u0131nda g\xF6rsellere
    ve videolara d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr.\n\n* AI Karakter Olu\u015Fturucu: Metin
    tan\u0131mlar\u0131na dayal\u0131 olarak detayl\u0131 karakterler olu\u015Fturabilirsiniz.\n\n*
    G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCden Videoya D\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrme: Statik g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCleri
    dinamik videolara d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrme imkan\u0131 sunar.\n\n* Y\xFCksek
    \xC7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCk Art\u0131r\u0131c\u0131: G\xF6rsellerinizin \xE7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    art\u0131rarak daha net ve profesyonel sonu\xE7lar elde edebilirsiniz.\n\n* \xC7oklu
    Stil Se\xE7enekleri: Anime, fantezi, fotoger\xE7ek\xE7i gibi \xE7e\u015Fitli
    stillerde i\xE7erikler olu\u015Fturabilirsiniz"
